# the instance folder of the demonstration service backend
# (doc_page_impl_service_instance.md). trying the Services tab creates
# instances here, and every instance keeps its data (notes.sqlite) in its own
# folder. everything new is ignored; only the files listed below are part of
# the example. to add an instance to the example on purpose, list its
# service.yaml here (or `git add -f` it).

*
!*/
!/.gitignore

!/w4veemd7i36--example notes/service.yaml
!/w4veemdrx8y--reading list/service.yaml
